# location the local edge-runtime reads automatically — must never be committed.
supabase/functions/.env
supabase/functions/.env.*

# Homepage Depth Pass (2026-09-08) — original media masters.
# These are the 8.2MB .mov and 6.4MB .jpeg the optimised files in assets/ were derived from.
# The derived files ARE committed (GitHub Pages serves them); the masters are not, because
# nothing at runtime reads them and they would add ~14.6MB to every clone. The exact ffmpeg
# and Pillow settings used to produce assets/ are recorded in CLAUDE.md, so the derivation is
# reproducible from a fresh copy of the masters.
AdobeStock_263939359.mov
AdobeStock_81432616.jpeg
